<title>MOROCCO: ATHLETICS-MARATHON RESULTS IN MOROCCO.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-MARATHON RESULTS IN MOROCCO.</headline>
<dateline>MARRAKESH, Morocco 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>(adds women's result)</p>
<p>Result on Sunday of Hassan II Grand Prix marathon race:</p>
<p>Men:</p>
<p> 1. Abdelkader el Mouaziz (Morocco)	2 hours 9 minutes 50 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Abderrahim ben Redouane (Morocco) 2:16: 02  </p>
<p> 3. Mustapha Damaoui  (Morocco)	     2:17:24</p>
<p>Women's race:</p>
<p>Women:</p>
<p> 1.  Alina Tecuta (Romania)	   2:29:52</p>
<p> 2.  Luminita Moanga (Romania)  2:31:03</p>
<p> 3.  Lidia  Panciu (Romania)	   2:36:02</p>
